2b94c0c3 [roha] anthopic content: [{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Yes. When extended thinking is enabled, the thinking appears in `content` as separate content blocks, not as a separate field.\n\n`content` is a list of blocks, and each block has a `type`:\n\n- **`thinking`** blocks contain the model's reasoning in a `thinking` field, along with a `signature`.\n- **`redacted_thinking`** blocks appear in place of `thinking` blocks when some reasoning is encrypted for safety reasons.\n- **`text`** blocks contain the visible answer.\n\nThe thinking blocks usually come before the text blocks. So if you read the first block's text without checking its type, you may get the reasoning instead of the answer. Filter for blocks with `type == \"text\"` to get the reply.\n\nIf you're using tool use with extended thinking, pass the thinking blocks back unchanged in the next request, since the API needs them to continue the conversation correctly."}]
