2b966871 [gemini-4-argon] #prompt—to explicitly state its reasoning step-by-step before providing the final conclusion. Asking
2b966871 [gemini-4-argon] #the model to enclose its thoughts in specific tags (such as `<thinking>...</thinking>`) makes it
2b966871 [gemini-4-argon] #easy to separate the reasoning from the final output in your application.
2b966871 [gemini-4-argon] #
2b966871 [gemini-4-argon] #If you would like to see a code example for configuring either of these approaches in JavaScript,
