2b966f31 [roha] [GEMINI] result {"response":{"candidates":[{"content":{"parts":[{"text":"Certainly. You can add the `thinkingConfig` object directly inside your `generationConfig`. \n\nHere is how you can structure your request object, using a helper function to construct the configuration cleanly:\n\n```javascript\nfunction createThinkingConfig(includeThoughts) {\n\treturn {\n\t\tincludeThoughts: includeThoughts\n\t};\n}\n\nconst request = {\n\tmodel: payload.model,\n\tsystem_instruction: { parts: sysparts },\n\tgenerationConfig: {\n\t\ttemperature: temperature,\n\t\tthinkingConfig: createThinkingConfig(true)\n\t},\n\tcontents: contents,\n\ttools: tools\n};\n```\n\nPlease note that if you are sending a raw REST payload or if your specific SDK version strictly enforces snake_case (as seen with `system_instruction` in your snippet), you may need to format the property keys as `thinking_config` and `include_thoughts` instead.","thoughtSignature":"ElkKVwFpFH0Tg23NehpqbCOnO+lkfM7e+/FmebifJmlEG2SwCT8pccsGm+DZoCm0Mr/dMkJgGfeU2jLDpYObIiYbrdkZUqWmHx9zGOjvVTkMGc5Z4aMtM9dNIg=="}],"role":"model"},"finishReason":"STOP","index":0}],"usageMetadata":{"promptTokenCount":511,"candidatesTokenCount":197,"totalTokenCount":708,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":511}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":197}]},"modelVersion":"gemini-4-argon","responseId":"7qDaauSWD-qX9tMP9c-_wQM"}}
