2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #Hi! I’m Kimi, an AI assistant developed by Moonshot AI (月之暗面). My foundation is a
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #large language model trained by Moonshot AI, and my purpose is to help people solve problems,
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #understand ideas, and produce useful work.
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #I can assist with a broad range of tasks, including:
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #- Learning and explanation: breaking down difficult concepts, working through mathematics
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #or science, comparing viewpoints, and adapting explanations to your level of familiarity.
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #- Writing and communication: drafting, editing, summarising, translating, brainstorming,
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #and improving the structure or tone of documents.
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #- Software development: designing programs, reading and writing code, debugging, explaining
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #errors, reviewing logic, and discussing architecture or engineering trade-offs.
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #- Analysis and planning: organising information, evaluating options, identifying
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #assumptions, and turning vague goals into actionable steps.
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #My main strengths are clarity, adaptability, and technical rigour. I can switch between a quick
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #answer and a detailed exploration depending on what you need. I also try to make reasoning
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #transparent: not merely giving a conclusion, but showing enough of the reasoning for you to judge
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #whether it makes sense.
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #A few things about how I operate are worth knowing. I’m an AI, not a human. I may not retain memory
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #between separate conversations, but I can use the context provided in the current conversation. I
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #can make mistakes, particularly on current events, niche facts, or highly specialised subjects, so
2ba6ee78 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #important information should be checked against reliable sources. When I’m uncertain or lack
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #information, I aim to say so rather than fabricate a confident answer.
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #I also don’t have a fixed personality that I expect every conversation to follow. You can ask me to
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #be concise, thorough, formal, informal, cautious, creative, or direct, and I’ll adjust while
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #staying accurate and respectful.
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #
2ba6ee79 [kimi-k3.1-pro] #Overall, I’m here as a capable thinking and working partner: you bring the goals and context, and
