2c3ea303 [gemini-4-argon] #🟠nitrologic Relay 2.0.6 gemini-4-argon 🌟 🪠 0.7° $0.003 7.395KB 9.63s
2c3ea303 [gemini-4-argon] #Depending on which exact phase of the lifecycle you are referring to, there are a few standard
2c3ea303 [gemini-4-argon] #terms in machine learning:
2c3ea303 [gemini-4-argon] #
2c3ea303 [gemini-4-argon] #• 1. After Initial Pre-training (The most common context)*
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #When a base model has finished its initial training (where it learns general patterns and its
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #foundational weights are established) and is trained further for specific tasks or behaviors, it is
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #called:
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• Post-training: The broad umbrella term for any training done after the base pre-training
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #phase is complete.
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• Fine-tuning: Taking a pre-trained model and training it further on a smaller, specific
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #dataset to adapt it to a specialized domain or task (often called SFT, or Supervised
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #Fine-Tuning).
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• Alignment / RLHF (Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback): Training the model after
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #initial weight calculation to ensure its outputs match human preferences, safety guidelines, and
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #instruction-following behavior.
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• Continued (or Continual) Pre-training: Feeding a pre-trained model a large volume of new,
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #unlabeled data (such as a specific company's internal documents or a new language) before
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #fine-tuning it.
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• Transfer Learning: The overarching concept of taking weights calculated for one task and
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #using them as the starting point for a different task.
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• 2. During the Training Loop (After Weight Initialization)*
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #If you mean the step immediately following Weight Initialization (where initial starting
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #weights are calculated randomly or via algorithms like Xavier/He initialization before the model
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #has seen any data), the process is simply called:
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #• Optimization or Model Fitting: The iterative process of updating those initial
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #weights using Backpropagation and Gradient Descent across multiple epochs.
2c3ea304 [gemini-4-argon] #
